      "description": "A juvenile ochu. This round little monster looks adorable todding around, but it would not do to forget that it is still an ochu. The diminutive microchu can move quickly and they often travel in packs, which means that travelers can easily find themselves surrounded by enemies if they do not keep a weather eye out. And where you find microchus, you find ochus not far behind. It is altogether safer to avoid these cute critters whenever possible."
